WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.875
What happens when 800 of the world's most elite footballers...

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:06.125
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:07.625
Players stop being polite...

00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:09.750
and start getting Re-al.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:10.500
This is...

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.625
The Champions.

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:15.250
This Halloween, I dressed up as a real, Premier League man.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.333
Hat-trick-or-treat!

00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:20.416
Ever since coming to Barcelona, it’s been difficult to connect with Messi.

00:00:20.416 --> 00:00:22.083
He's never online!

00:00:22.083 --> 00:00:25.083
OK. Just hold on for one second. I want to send this.

00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:26.458
It's going to be so funny.

00:00:26.875 --> 00:00:28.958
What, what? Oh, no. Oh, no.

00:00:28.958 --> 00:00:30.166
Delete, delete, delete, delete!

00:00:43.958 --> 00:00:47.041
Man, I haven’t seen Leo this frustrated since...

00:00:47.041 --> 00:00:49.375
after every single international tournament.

00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:53.833
The Neymar transfer falling through has really put Messi in a mood this season.

00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:56.750
I don’t think a trip to the pottery shop is going to solve this one.

00:00:57.541 --> 00:01:01.291
Hmm….maybe Messi needs to talk with someone on his level.

00:01:01.291 --> 00:01:04.625
Oh, yes. This is a very good idea. I will talk him to him now!

00:01:04.625 --> 00:01:07.125
Ah. No. I meant Ronaldo.

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:09.833
Pique say I should ask Ronaldo to dinner,

00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:12.833
because he is the only person who understands,

00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:16.666
you know, how it feel to always be around worse players.

00:01:16.666 --> 00:01:17.916
So, are you excited?

00:01:17.916 --> 00:01:19.541
Eh...no.

00:01:21.166 --> 00:01:23.125
Um...everything OK in there?

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:25.083
No! Look.

00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:26.375
I don’t see what’s wrong.

00:01:26.375 --> 00:01:28.083
How many abs you see? How many abs?

00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:29.541
Uh...eight.

00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:32.083
Oh god. No, no, no!

00:01:32.083 --> 00:01:32.833
Why is that bad?

00:01:32.833 --> 00:01:35.708
My ninth ab is gone! I am truly aging.

00:01:35.708 --> 00:01:38.041
Ninth ab? Is that a thing?

00:01:38.041 --> 00:01:40.333
Ugh, Cristiano, your phone is blowing up.

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:41.500
Ew. I don’t know this number.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.541
Have one of the center-backs clear that. Thank you.

00:01:43.541 --> 00:01:45.916
Uh...I think that is, uh, actually Messi’s number.

00:01:45.916 --> 00:01:47.458
Oh my god. No it's not. Shut up. Shut up.

00:01:47.958 --> 00:01:51.291
I mean...whatever...I mean...pfft…what does he want? You know?

00:01:51.291 --> 00:01:53.125
Probably Champions League tips

00:01:53.125 --> 00:01:56.291
because I have, uh, 127 Champions League goals

00:01:56.291 --> 00:01:58.291
and he has, like, 113 or something...

00:01:58.291 --> 00:02:00.291
I don’t know, I don’t pay attention to that stuff.

00:02:00.291 --> 00:02:01.875
Now if you’ll excuse me, Karim,

00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:06.500
I guess I’ll see what Lionel Messi wants to talk to me about.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:09.291
Karim?

00:02:09.291 --> 00:02:12.208
I’m pretty sure he thinks I’m Karim Benzema.

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:14.666
So...Leo Messi has asked me to dinner.

00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:16.375
What do you think you want to talk to him about?

00:02:16.375 --> 00:02:20.541
You know, to be honest, I don’t have many people in my life who say the truth.

00:02:20.541 --> 00:02:23.708
So they all will just say, 'Ronaldo, you are so great,'

00:02:23.708 --> 00:02:28.208
'Ronaldo, you are the best,' 'Ronaldo, you are not guilty'— you know, things like that.

00:02:28.208 --> 00:02:32.500
But if Messi says that I'm the best, you know, then it must be the truth.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.291
But I’m sure he thinks he is the best...except for the looks, of course.

00:02:43.375 --> 00:02:48.750
So…uh…Van Dijk? UEFA Player of the Year, eh?

00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:51.125
Si.

00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:53.958
Uh, it is stupid award, you know, like...

00:02:53.958 --> 00:02:56.041
I mean, please, the guy has one good year,

00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:59.458
but honestly, like, I honest...I think he kind of sucks.

00:03:00.666 --> 00:03:02.291
I think he is very good player.

00:03:02.291 --> 00:03:04.791
Well, yeah, yeah, I mean, of course, for sure he is very good,

00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:07.625
I mean, I don't want to take anything away from him, I just mean, like,

00:03:07.625 --> 00:03:09.333
he isn’t as good as us, but yeah,

00:03:09.333 --> 00:03:12.375
I mean I totally, I know what you're saying, like, he's obviously—

00:03:14.916 --> 00:03:17.583
I will tell you the specials.

00:03:17.583 --> 00:03:20.166
Memories they are prison.

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:24.041
Nothing we can call our own, but death,

00:03:24.041 --> 00:03:27.708
and that small model of barren earth,

00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:31.958
which serves as a paste and a cover to our bones...

00:03:33.166 --> 00:03:35.833
Today's special is a French onion soup.

00:03:36.541 --> 00:03:37.666
I will have the goat.

00:03:37.666 --> 00:03:41.916
Yikes. Ah, no! Don’t eat me. Hehe...er.

00:03:43.416 --> 00:03:45.833
Um...I will have the cod, please. Thanks.

00:03:48.083 --> 00:03:49.500
So...here we are.

00:03:50.458 --> 00:03:58.000
Ronaldo and Messi...just...having dinner, you know. Can you believe it?

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.208
Si.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.791
Yeah...right.

00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:07.708
So…uh…how dumb are taxes, right?

00:04:09.791 --> 00:04:13.333
OK...um...what...uh...was there, like,

00:04:13.333 --> 00:04:16.333
a reason you wanted to have dinner, because...

00:04:16.333 --> 00:04:18.000
I need to eat to have energy.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:22.166
Yes, obviously, but I mean...like...a reason to eat with me?

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:23.916
Si.

00:04:24.666 --> 00:04:26.041
OK...and?

00:04:26.041 --> 00:04:27.208
To talk.

00:04:27.208 --> 00:04:29.416
OK, but you don’t say anything.

00:04:29.666 --> 00:04:32.041
I like to let my football do the talking.

00:04:32.041 --> 00:04:33.833
OK, then what am I even doing here?

00:04:33.833 --> 00:04:38.500
This is stupid. This was a stupid idea. We are not the same. OK, I am a brand...

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:43.166
and you are just like...a...um...a football robot or something.

00:04:45.458 --> 00:04:49.583
Yeah, run away like you ran away from La Liga...p---y ass b---h.

00:04:49.583 --> 00:04:50.916
What did you say?

00:04:50.916 --> 00:04:53.166
I said, uh, 'thank you.'

00:04:53.166 --> 00:04:54.583
Thank you?

00:04:54.583 --> 00:04:57.000
Si. You solved my problem.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:59.458
Before I was mad that we did not get Neymar,

00:04:59.458 --> 00:05:01.458
but now you have reminded me

00:05:01.458 --> 00:05:05.916
that the greatest players have giant egos, and are not fun to play with.

00:05:05.916 --> 00:05:07.708
You are the best, Ronaldo.

00:05:07.708 --> 00:05:10.250
Wait...I’m the…the best?

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:12.541
Well, no, I did not mean like—

00:05:12.541 --> 00:05:15.541
Did you guys hear this? Lionel Messi just said I am the best!

00:05:15.541 --> 00:05:18.541
Did you guys hear this? Lionel Messi just said I am the best!

00:05:18.541 --> 00:05:21.291
Media! Any media! Did you hear this?

00:05:21.291 --> 00:05:24.291
Messi said Ronaldo is the best.

00:05:24.291 --> 00:05:25.791
That is not what I meant.

00:05:25.791 --> 00:05:29.083
Oh, I heard it as clear as Crystal Palace!

00:05:29.083 --> 00:05:31.500
Huh! Crystal Palace? Huh? Where!?

00:05:54.458 --> 00:05:56.791
I will not promote this cartoon.

00:05:56.916 --> 00:05:58.541
But I will!

00:05:58.625 --> 00:06:00.750
Subscribe to BR Football

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.500
to support The Champions!

